    "html": "<p>When two waves, each of amplitude <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span>, interfere constructively, the resultant intensity is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I\"></span>. What is the resultant intensity during constructive interference when the amplitude of the first wave is halved and the amplitude of the second wave is doubled?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{25I}{16}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{5I}{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{25I}{4}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
